Q: iOS 26 MapKit custom Annotation bug A: <p>I use <code>MKMarkerAnnotationView</code> instead of <code>MKAnnotationView</code> because I need to display title at all times and resolved <code>MKMarkerBalloonView</code> issue with overriding <code>didAddSubview</code> function in my <code>MKMarkerAnnotationView</code></p>
<pre><code>override func didAddSubview(_ subview: UIView) {
    if NSStringFromClass(type(of: subview)) == &quot;MKMarkerBalloonView&quot; {
        subview.removeFromSuperview()
    }
}
</code></pre>

